        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia RECTDB, Contemporary Square Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUndeniably alluring in design, this <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy</b></a> collection single cylinder square deadbolt lock will add a contemporary accent to your door. It is available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets with 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. Available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia RECTDB Contemporary Square Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: 5 pin, Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced door frame strike with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>1\" Throw deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-deadbolt-install.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Deadbolt Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia RECTDB Contemporary Square Auxiliary Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2-5/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Optional 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Square Deadbolt, Omnia RECTDB",
                "description": "Single Cylinder Square Deadbolt, Omnia RECTDB - Undeniably alluring in design, this Omnia Prodigy collection single cylinder square deadbolt lock will add a contemporary accent to your door. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. Available in 8 finishes.",
